- [PDF] Marketing Strategies of Maruti Suzuki - Ijrpr: International Journal of Research Publication and Reviews, Vol 6, Issue 6, pp 5625-5628 June 2025 International Journal of Research Publication and Reviews Journal homepage: www.ijrpr.com ISSN 2582-7421 Marketing Strategies of Maruti Suzuki Anushri Srivastava Galgotias University,Greater Noida, India E-mail address : anushri.23gsob2010904@galgotiasuniversity.ac.in DOI : https://doi.org/10.55248/gengpi.6.0625.21120 ABSTRACT The introduction of the Maruti Suzuki Swift in 2005 marked a significant transformation in India’s automotive industry. By blending European-inspired aesthetics with robust engineering and modern amenities such as airbags, ABS, and climate control, the Swift not only redefined consumer expectations but also set new industry benchmarks in the compact car segment. This research paper critically examines the factors that contributed to the Swift's remarkable success, including market conditions prior to its launch, the competitive landscape, and Maruti Suzuki’s strategic decisions in product positioning and pricing. This study concludes that the Maruti Suzuki Swift not only revolutionized the hatchback segment but also played a pivotal role in shaping the future trajectory of India’s passenger vehicle industry. Keywords : Maruti Suzuki Swift, Indian Automotive Market, Consumer Behavior, Hatchback Segment, Market Competition 1.
