## 6. What Is the Marketing Strategy of Maruti Suzuki?

Maruti Suzuki’s marketing strategy is closely tied to trust, reach, and channel architecture rather than pure image-building. The corporate brand has long stood for fuel efficiency, practicality, serviceability, and affordability. That message is especially important in India’s mass market, where purchase decisions are heavily shaped by running cost and resale value. [...] Entry and mini cars: models such as Alto K10 and S-Presso target highly price-sensitive buyers and first-time car ownership.
