- India EV Car Sales: May 2026 became a... - The Daily Jagran: ### **The Daily Jagran**. India EV Car Sales: May 2026 became a new inflection point in the history of the Indian electric vehicle industry, as it recorded a new all-time monthly high by selling more than 26,000 electric cars. While Tata has remained the segment leader in May 2026 electric car sales, Maruti Suzuki, the largest car manufacturer in India, has cracked the top 5 EV makers’ list. Maruti Suzuki Electric Car Sales. Maruti Suzuki currently offers a single model, the Maruti Suzuki E Vitara, in the country. The brand registered a surge in demand for the E Vitara, and the total sales stood at 4,365 units in May 2026. It recorded sales of a total of 2,254 units in March 2026, and the sales dropped on a month-on-month basis in April 2026, as the brand recorded sales of a total of 2,006 units. May be an image of ‎car, road and ‎text that says '‎THE DAILY Jagran ل VITARA Maruti Suzuki Cracks Top 5 EV Makers' List In India; Overtakes Hyundai, BYD And VinFast‎'‎‎. [in C:\Users\Gaurav Srivastava\Desktop\dashify\api\routes\insights.py:244]
