- An Assessment of Customer Satisfaction with Maruti Suzuki ...: © Volume 2, Issue 6, June 2026 | JATIR 140758 Journal of Academic Trends & Innovative Research (JATIR) | www.jatir.org 3203 An Assessment of Customer Satisfaction with Maruti Suzuki Cars in Dwarka, Delhi 1 Namita Yadav, 2Avnish Kumar, 3Anjali kumari 1Assistant Professor, NCWEB, University of Delhi, 2Assistant Professor, Keshav Mahavidyalay, University of Delhi, 3 Research scholar, University of Delhi ABSTRACT The Indian automobile industry has witnessed remarkable growth over the last decade, with passenger vehicles playing a significant role in the transportation sector. Maruti Suzuki continues to be the market leader in India due to its extensive product portfolio, fuel efficiency, affordability, and widespread service network. Customer satisfaction is a key determinant of brand loyalty and repeat purchase behavior in the automobile industry. The present study aims to analyze the level of customer satisfaction towards Maruti Suzuki cars in Dwarka, Delhi. Keywords: Maruti Suzuki Cars, Customer Satisfaction, Consumer Behaviour, Automobile Industry, Dwarka Delhi, After-Sales Service.
